{"version":1,"content":"<p>殿堂組合草蜢成員蔡一傑，近日與胞兄蔡一智合體，現身紅磡香港體育館為《衛蘭演唱會2026》擔任表演嘉賓。</p><p>由於另一成員蘇志威身在外地未能趕及返港，草蜢罕有地以「二缺一」陣容登場。</p><p>然而，在正式踏上舞台前，蔡一傑卻在紅館場外遇上一段令人啼笑皆非的「</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T09:11:37.216840+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T09:01:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T09:04:48.612652+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T09:04:48.612652+00:00","content_hash":"c7f369e1841ef2d39d4c80f3146780e4e2ea92c2c3df0d70f9ed08f7ee7ff277","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}